cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the article below and this software repository."
title: "PRMT8 in inhibitory neurons: single-nucleus RNA-seq analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a study of PRMT8 in inhibitory neurons, combining a
  multi-cohort human brain snRNA-seq atlas (Alzheimer's disease, Parkinson's
  disease, multiple sclerosis, epilepsy and controls), a mouse Prmt8
  conditional-knockout atlas with chemogenetic (Gq-DREADD) manipulation, and
  human cortical organoids (GSE203201).
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-02"
license: MIT

authors:
